<% content_for :title, "Popover" %>
<div class="mb-8">
  <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400">Components</p>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Popover</h1>
  <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
    A click-triggered floating panel for rich HTML content — links, forms, details, actions.
    Closes on click-outside or Escape. Positioned with Floating UI.
  </p>
</div>

<%# Preview %>
<h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">Preview</h2>
<div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 flex items-center justify-center gap-6 p-12 mb-8">
  <%= render Ui::PopoverComponent.new(placement: "bottom", panel_classes: "w-64 p-4") do |p| %>
    <% p.with_trigger do %>
      <button class="rounded-md bg-neutral-900 dark:bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white dark:text-neutral-900 hover:bg-neutral-700 dark:hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors">
        Open popover
      </button>
    <% end %>
    <% p.with_panel do %>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Popover title</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-3">Rich HTML content — any markup goes here.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <button class="rounded px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium bg-neutral-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-neutral-900 hover:bg-neutral-700">Confirm</button>
        <button class="rounded px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-600 hover:bg-neutral-50 dark:hover:bg-neutral-700">Cancel</button>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
</div>

<%# Usage %>
<h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">Usage</h2>
<div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-neutral-800 mb-8">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-neutral-900 px-4 py-2">
    <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">ERB</span>
    <button data-copy-target="#popover-usage" class="text-xs text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">Copy</button>
  </div>
  <pre class="bg-neutral-950 px-5 py-4 overflow-x-auto text-sm leading-relaxed"><code id="popover-usage" class="text-neutral-200"><%= h(example_popover_usage) %></code></pre>
</div>

<%# Options %>
<h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">Options</h2>
<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 mb-8">
  <table class="w-full text-sm">
    <thead class="bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900">
      <tr>
        <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Name</th>
        <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Type</th>
        <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Default</th>
        <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Description</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody class="divide-y divide-neutral-100 dark:divide-neutral-800">
      <% [
        ["placement",    "String",  '"bottom"', "Floating UI placement. Supports all 12 positions."],
        ["offset",       "Integer", "8",        "Gap in pixels between the trigger and the panel."],
        ["panel_classes","String",  '""',       "Additional Tailwind classes merged onto the panel wrapper (e.g. w-64 p-4)."],
      ].each do |name, type, default, desc| %>
        <tr class="hover:bg-neutral-50 dark:hover:bg-neutral-900/50">
          <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400"><%= name %></td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-neutral-500"><%= type %></td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400"><%= default %></td>
          <td class="px-4 py-3 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400"><%= desc %></td>
        </tr>
      <% end %>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<%# Slots %>
<h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">Slots</h2>
<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 mb-8">
  <table class="w-full text-sm">
    <thead class="bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900">
      <tr>
        <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Name</th>
        <th class="text-left px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Description</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody class="divide-y divide-neutral-100 dark:divide-neutral-800">
      <tr>
        <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400">trigger</td>
        <td class="px-4 py-3 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">The button or element that toggles the panel open/closed.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400">panel</td>
        <td class="px-4 py-3 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">The floating panel content. Any HTML — links, forms, text, actions.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<%# Controller %>
<h2 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">Stimulus Controller</h2>
<p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-3">
  <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">ui--popover</code>
</p>
<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 list-disc list-inside">
  <li>Click on the trigger wrapper toggles the <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">openValue</code> boolean; open/close animate via opacity + scale.</li>
  <li>Click-outside and <kbd class="text-xs border border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-600 rounded px-1">Esc</kbd> close the panel and return focus to the trigger.</li>
  <li>Manages <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">aria-expanded</code> and <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">aria-haspopup</code> on the trigger element.</li>
  <li>Reposition on scroll/resize while open.</li>
  <li>Public methods: <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">toggle()</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">open()</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 px-1 py-0.5 rounded">close()</code>.</li>
</ul>
